      "writtenOn": "2023-04-21T23:01:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think there are details here:\n1. We are creating a platform select statement even though `foolib` does not have //apex_available:platform\n2. We are making the platform variant of `foolib` link against impl of `barlib` (causing discrepancies with Soong)\n\nFor (2), in principle, we should not enforce an api boundary since barlib is a platform library, so all platform variants should be allowed to link against it freely. \n\nLiz, are you concerned that this might cause subtle differences between soong and Bazel which would be hard to debug?",
      "parentUuid": "3fd9cbd2_73abaafc",
      "range": {
